			"notes": "For **Minecraft 1.21.1**, **NeoForge 21.1.251+**, and **Java 21**.\n\nConfigurable climate and biome requirements for crops, saplings, and other plants.\n\n- Biomes Notebook with biome habitats and greenhouse requirements.\n- Electrical Thermoregulator with five climate settings and directional airflow.\n- Thermometer for reading the local climate and biome.\n\nPlace `biome_based_crops-neoforge-1.21.1-1.0.0.jar` in the client and server `mods` folders. Config files are generated on first launch."
